{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an action-packed adventure in <i>Dungeon Rampage</i>, the ultimate revival of the cult-classic online multiplayer dungeon crawler! Team up with friends or stand alone as you fight your way through monster-filled dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/9403d438f6399853cda8f811da5d6ecb.poster.avif?t=1764957289\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/9403d438f6399853cda8f811da5d6ecb.webm?t=1764957289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/9403d438f6399853cda8f811da5d6ecb.mp4?t=1764957289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your champion from a roster of unique heroes. Each hero has distinct abilities, weapons, and play styles. Whether you prefer the Berserker\u2019s brute force, the Vampire Hunter\u2019s cunning traps, or the Pyromancer\u2019s elemental mayhem, there\u2019s a hero to unlock for every type of player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/f88829b2b6973f12f283e26a284e77f8.avif?t=1764957289\" width=720 height=229 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your heroes to upgrade their abilities and customize your loadouts! With hundreds of different weapons to equip, you can fine-tune your build to match your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/bb7ab0b2fcfa94f494986806c613eaf5.poster.avif?t=1764957289\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/bb7ab0b2fcfa94f494986806c613eaf5.webm?t=1764957289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/bb7ab0b2fcfa94f494986806c613eaf5.mp4?t=1764957289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally with up to 3 friends or match with players from the community and tear through dungeons teeming with deadly traps, ruthless enemies, and hidden treasure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/85b920951c815f0321239bdb182e8976.poster.avif?t=1764957289\" width=800 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/85b920951c815f0321239bdb182e8976.webm?t=1764957289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/85b920951c815f0321239bdb182e8976.mp4?t=1764957289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a pet to join you on the battlefield and watch them destroy your enemies in your stead: take your pick between rhinos, wolves, dragons and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/33453bcfe5d2af1396232461940e2824.avif?t=1764957289\" width=800 height=269 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With procedurally generated dungeons, there is endless replayability. Face new challenges every time you play, from massive boss battles to cleverly hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/0e0081e31d9f63720e66c2a4aada5405.avif?t=1764957289\" width=800 height=468 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game just as it was, with quality of life improvements! Originally released on Facebook in 2012 and shut down in 2017, Dungeon Rampage was doomed to disappear when Flash was officially discontinued, rendering the game unplayable and leaving its 8 million player base without a home. We\u2019re restored the game and are modernizing the original experience as we are working on polishing and expanding the content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you in the dungeon, rampagers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/f4689e667fbec95c2732ede24c9de385.poster.avif?t=1764957289\" width=800 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/f4689e667fbec95c2732ede24c9de385.webm?t=1764957289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/f4689e667fbec95c2732ede24c9de385.mp4?t=1764957289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3053950?t=1764957289","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3053950?t=1764957289","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/c08c8710daa9fb288739509050f112a9704162b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764957289","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/c08c8710daa9fb288739509050f112a9704162b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764957289","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an action-packed adventure in <i>Dungeon Rampage</i>, the ultimate revival of the cult-classic online multiplayer dungeon crawler! Team up with friends or stand alone as you fight your way through monster-filled dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/9403d438f6399853cda8f811da5d6ecb.poster.avif?t=1764957289\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/9403d438f6399853cda8f811da5d6ecb.webm?t=1764957289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/9403d438f6399853cda8f811da5d6ecb.mp4?t=1764957289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your champion from a roster of unique heroes. Each hero has distinct abilities, weapons, and play styles. Whether you prefer the Berserker\u2019s brute force, the Vampire Hunter\u2019s cunning traps, or the Pyromancer\u2019s elemental mayhem, there\u2019s a hero to unlock for every type of player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/f88829b2b6973f12f283e26a284e77f8.avif?t=1764957289\" width=720 height=229 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your heroes to upgrade their abilities and customize your loadouts! With hundreds of different weapons to equip, you can fine-tune your build to match your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/bb7ab0b2fcfa94f494986806c613eaf5.poster.avif?t=1764957289\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/bb7ab0b2fcfa94f494986806c613eaf5.webm?t=1764957289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/bb7ab0b2fcfa94f494986806c613eaf5.mp4?t=1764957289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally with up to 3 friends or match with players from the community and tear through dungeons teeming with deadly traps, ruthless enemies, and hidden treasure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/85b920951c815f0321239bdb182e8976.poster.avif?t=1764957289\" width=800 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/85b920951c815f0321239bdb182e8976.webm?t=1764957289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/85b920951c815f0321239bdb182e8976.mp4?t=1764957289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a pet to join you on the battlefield and watch them destroy your enemies in your stead: take your pick between rhinos, wolves, dragons and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/33453bcfe5d2af1396232461940e2824.avif?t=1764957289\" width=800 height=269 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With procedurally generated dungeons, there is endless replayability. Face new challenges every time you play, from massive boss battles to cleverly hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/0e0081e31d9f63720e66c2a4aada5405.avif?t=1764957289\" width=800 height=468 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game just as it was, with quality of life improvements! Originally released on Facebook in 2012 and shut down in 2017, Dungeon Rampage was doomed to disappear when Flash was officially discontinued, rendering the game unplayable and leaving its 8 million player base without a home. We\u2019re restored the game and are modernizing the original experience as we are working on polishing and expanding the content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you in the dungeon, rampagers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/f4689e667fbec95c2732ede24c9de385.poster.avif?t=1764957289\" width=800 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/f4689e667fbec95c2732ede24c9de385.webm?t=1764957289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/f4689e667fbec95c2732ede24c9de385.mp4?t=1764957289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["Gamebreaking Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/ca7c1413a5548f7cb100eecbc3218f6be6bacbcf/header.jpg?t=1764957289","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<s